a plan and never a lock) for "Lesson time 5:00" on the child's Home. shared/contracts.ts has no field for it, so a client
that reads it needs a cast. The app reads it through `scheduleFrom` in src/child/plan.ts today (structural, tested); once
this lands that cast can go.

